{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52805","headline":"春兴 · 贺知章","name":"春兴","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"泉喷（疑）横琴膝，花黏漉酒巾。\n盃中不觉老，林下更逢春。\n（日本藏唐抄本《新撰类林抄》卷四，转引自日本京都大学《中国文学报》一九五九年第十一期刊小川环树《〈新撰类林抄〉校读记》）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贺知章","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52805.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52805","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}